                        </ref>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">General</hi>: <list>
                            <item>The Conference for the Reduction and Limitation of Armaments,
                                Geneva: 1935 phase: <list>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg1">I. Meeting of the Special Committee for
                                            the Trade in and Private and State Manufacture of Arms
                                            and Implements of War, February 14–April 13, 1935</ref>
                                    </item>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg48">II. First reading of text prepared by
                                            the United States (November 20, 1934)</ref>
                                    </item>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg62">III. Closing of the Geneva office of the
                                            American Delegation</ref>
                                    </item>
                                </list>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg64">London Naval Conference, 1935</ref>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <ref target="#pg162">The Anglo-German Naval Agreement, June 18,
