                        </list>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">The Near East and Africa</hi>: <list>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Afghanistan</hi>: <list>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg555">Unsuccessful negotiations between the
                                            United States and Afghanistan looking toward a
                                            provisional agreement in regard to friendship,
                                            diplomatic and consular representation, juridical
                                            protection, and commercial relations</ref>
                                    </item>
                                </list>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Egypt</hi>: <list>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg565">Statement by the Department of State
                                            relating to the official status of the American Consular
                                            Court at Cairo</ref>
                                    </item>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg567">Attempt by the Egyptian Government to
                                            obtain a greater degree of equality between the Egyptian
                                            and foreign elements in the organization and procedure
                                            of the Mixed Courts</ref>
                                    </item>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg577">Reservation by the United States
                                            Government regarding the reorganization of the
                                            Municipality of Alexandria by unilateral action of the
                                            Egyptian Government</ref>
                                    </item>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg584">Decision by the Egyptian Government to
                                            participate in sanctions against Italy, without regard
                                            to Italy’s capitulatory privileges in Egypt</ref>
                                    </item>
                                </list>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ethiopia</hi>: <list>
                                    <item>Ethiopian-Italian conflict: <list>
                                            <item>
                                                <ref target="#pg594">I. Efforts by the League of
                                                  Nations and by France and the United Kingdom for a
                                                  peaceful settlement of the dispute between
                                                  Ethiopia and Italy, January–September, 1935</ref>
                                            </item>
                                            <item>
                                                <ref target="#pg662">II. Italian invasion of
                                                  Ethiopia; efforts of the League of Nations and of
                                                  France and the United Kingdom to end hostilities,
                                                  October–December, 1935</ref>
                                            </item>
                                            <item>
                                                <ref target="#pg723">III. Attitude of the United
                                                  States regarding proposals for invocation of
                                                  Kellogg Pact and mediation; appeal by the United
                                                  States to Italy for a peaceful settlement</ref>
                                            </item>
                                            <item>
                                                <ref target="#pg778">IV. Cancellation by the
                                                  Standard Vacuum Oil Company of a concession in
                                                  Ethiopia upon the advice of the Department of
                                                  State</ref>
                                            </item>
                                            <item>
                                                <ref target="#pg784">V. Application of the
                                                  neutrality laws of the United States</ref>
                                            </item>
                                            <item>
                                                <ref target="#pg836">VI. Refusal of the United
                                                  States to associate itself with League of Nations
                                                  sanctions against Italy</ref>
                                            </item>
                                            <item>
                                                <ref target="#pg876">VII. Protection of American
                                                  life and property in Ethiopia</ref>
                                            </item>
                                        </list>
                                    </item>
                                </list>
                            </item>
                            <pb facs="0013" n="IX" xml:id="pgIX"/>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Iran</hi>: <list>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg909">Preliminary discussions respecting a
                                            trade agreement between the United States and Iran</ref>
                                    </item>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg916">Reservation of American rights against
                                            Iran’s attempt by unilateral action to extend its
                                            exclusive jurisdiction over coastal waters beyond the
                                            three-mile limit</ref>
                                    </item>
                                </list>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Liberia</hi>: <list>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg920">Recognition by the United States of the
                                            administration of President Barclay upon evidence of the
                                            Liberian Government’s intention to carry out certain
                                            reforms</ref>
                                    </item>
                                </list>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Morocco</hi>: <list>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg951">Objection of the United States to
                                            proposed modification of the customs regime in the
                                            French Zone of Morocco</ref>
                                    </item>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg998">Negotiations concerning claims and
                                            proposed recognition by the United States of the Spanish
                                            Zone in Morocco</ref>
                                    </item>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg1018">Representations by the United States
                                            against discriminatory passport regulations in the
                                            Spanish Zone of Morocco</ref>
                                    </item>
                                </list>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Turkey</hi>: <list>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg1026">Attitude of the United States toward
                                            efforts by Turkey to secure revision of the regime of
                                            the Straits; consideration of possible agreement with
                                            Turkey regarding American navigation rights</ref>
                                    </item>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg1043">Policy of the Department of State to
                                            encourage multilateral trade rather than to attempt to
                                            overcome unfavorable balance of trade with Turkey</ref>
                                    </item>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg1046">Application with respect to Turkey of
                                            policy of the United States not to encourage American
                                            firms in the sale of arms and munitions of war</ref>
                                    </item>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg1052">Rejection of request of the Turkish
                                            Government for assignment of an American Army officer as
                                            instructor in the Turkish Air Forces</ref>
                                    </item>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg1053">Representations by the Turkish Embassy
                                            against filming the novel, “The Forty Days of Musa
                                            Dagh”</ref>
                                    </item>
                                </list>
                            </item>
                        </list>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                        <ref target="#pg1059">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Index</hi>
                        </ref>
                    </item>
                </list>
            </div>
